{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30002_01_j",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:501c06e0562cb25a4ec3ea8949a28be610e2dc319ec950700948d258f2fa26e3",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_j:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36c39a6e425c0c41ba11d74816336a2e18b89800e21a402afa8a7092964584fa",
      "text": "Wonderful！\n非常exciting的drama呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_j:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:157fef80f0c3dcda8edafe426c0e48ed3f3a5aacf6ca97b9039a03aa964e711f",
      "text": "嗯。想必他也一定会感到高兴吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_j:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a4c63d124b4dc11a93e35d5561a17f31d349d96885d2f39a0f71a6bfb1967e0f",
      "text": "虽然每天每天都在背台词和拍摄，\n挺辛苦的……不过这番努力很值得呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_j:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e86d23809785de3b786bc7d5f5ab5d14bed9f96c1a458d8d867912e2537cb156",
      "text": "说起来，我有好好找到\n●●●●プロデューサー酱出场的地方哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_j:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02ff6ade000c5fd82a2d764eff9b93c03c367586df9223d1e9bcd4f969b54f9a",
      "text": "啊哈哈，亏你能注意到呢。\n因为人手不够，我只是以配角客串了一个镜头而已。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_j:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53f5851d210c7a0d81d9fab8605bbbb1abdb2138074cc313a927523534fd7484",
      "text": "……咦。最后一个镜头，好像有一条留言\n呢。这个，难道不是写给各位的吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_j:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3bd92592780ad06ea043aeb869de3161867666271b2487c3e8bb2b6625f9c844",
      "text": "哎？呃……\n“无惧失败，不畏挫折，勇往直前”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_j:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2610ea6c4dbd953799a0010cbedebd35f2facb5e76ba75cf1aa995c5f963afe2",
      "text": "“因为这一定会化为迈向梦想的一步”！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_j:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d256a19c96ef9cf2113160254cc430f684cd4771705c63edd771ea3c9dea0db3",
      "text": "“谨向再次赋予我这份勇气的\n老师们，致以最诚挚的感谢”……吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30002_01:1_3_30002_01_j:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:784eb19b10a980aa57569136f80d488fe4aef89591b7f4f0336f160e49ce1c90",
      "text": "……看来作为偶像，我们切实地\n引领了他啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
